  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3786bf3fdb3853345271aec5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要拼命去跑就一定能\r\n跑出好结果的──\r\n不要担心哦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21d2da69c67097a34bf146e5826373a042345161e31aebf0d1a4ec6224e4cd9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:576a8e4952c1f7d5d78422a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要想开心的事情，\r\n让心情变得乌拉拉～的！\r\n快变快变──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19b0d95431e1d66d3842201883028e32e0622c6e0a42da8c6d0267d439272ca3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca01f5a30b74068fe5abdc4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态不好，\r\n只要跟训练员一起就能赢的，对吧！\r\n我会努力到最后一刻的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf4d321fad12e4168bea23fde281f3cc63a5bdc14b4297510387057aaf2c560a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:319f68e3137de20b23335d0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像……感觉怪怪的──\r\n但我没有紧张来着，嗯──",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e48cf750a0fbb55b7705953c143fb9448a76923493eae967637f859dc4fcb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb49b52b5b645687bd9d3ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……等正式比赛的时候\r\n应该就能开心跑了吧，嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a761bae79deea07bd41323a84abf3ee86c8d445291af623891943f20ca0ca18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4151b73f6c1f9dbb02403a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你有带点心吗？\r\n吃点甜食我说不定就有活力了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9cd9d905976754c84a563c453db4f4cb7a2b0373a17938c33be09ba52706470",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d31d7732a4212dba7cc3ffbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上咯──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca2a2ce423e0b297fc818e8169f4c42f597498205d359d90c942e499cf720ade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a8a6002b89b17d4d0e1996",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db95a6e34418f71cec4b0140abc3bcef785172741eb057198a0c002fed614c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a530365fd5385bbb58c260",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我要上了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec6b9518c279d37e6c0962abb0071abb6b80f9154f64c5f9692630449fca12f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbeb55e680cba2e24b9e6268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯──",
      "source_fingerprint": "66e1b4bd184e2a44352ab08df34b2d8aa4720be986bf6981873a85d3316969eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c32143651ed65b21e80009",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee042e5fa5c00d170a94472f1e2bb4024380c59e444db700f5bc3f36dcf042cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20c4e4e17c7ff369028b1c3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噗咻……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3643b72ce146dbcc7b169c1f1fddc2b686043451af1c8b327f04c6f9eca2f856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f6896b7cc27b7510b7444e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出门了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f98493e5096c2968db91fecdade2cb2a2d7cc4732e686ea4124ec3862ca5bd1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b0e1f401cbf9cb5e2926e59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们要去海边啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86e6a3032b1e3e98cb86b14c4a21859e5df900b12abd9613adf10791395adbd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4f9acf04603b19367c320a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力一定能做到！没错吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "83d0c36c258e980dd9f763f3d32d49c4281f27d7f94744e6b8050ca4dfdfafde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab0634e3601da706b05a12a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ea117a96fc6bbba2c10196f1e8878813ab4f142b75090c72cbbe86e6f057fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f359e32cccd90893185f8667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，我们一起努力吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fba2221516e15f0284aa029140bec93cd958a1333fbd657f4d42dfceed79af9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:786e3982240e3eaa32706ac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上咯──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca2a2ce423e0b297fc818e8169f4c42f597498205d359d90c942e499cf720ade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66b418b804c318dc95b1f8bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家──！我们一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10c39ad59565216852097cb3d64f8e062541e7d536cdc88805db4a86945f5eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d59f9eb8709c2baa6d9d5986",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ea117a96fc6bbba2c10196f1e8878813ab4f142b75090c72cbbe86e6f057fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e233b694bb634663b0829900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是都叫做状态……吗？\r\n我觉得好像还不错哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d3bee93f473d6ed62d406932c0076659201ac038734d40ffed96f9844ed063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9dc7cf64037a58a567dc73e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始前就我就有一种\r\n很乌拉拉～的感觉♪\r\n赢了我们就吃胡萝卜布丁来庆祝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "517d4fc784ba1021b276102d1d79eecb27eff14ed4fa64be4a8111f91f0516b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c566e287f9ee22d150f3d3c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ea117a96fc6bbba2c10196f1e8878813ab4f142b75090c72cbbe86e6f057fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45078279a6e64d8026a16286",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よし、やるぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1c32af70fba4504bfacc3056143e2b7e7c0fdfce5fdcbd645e9b583e5cb1481",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cefcc1ff233f173d9af707a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好棒好棒──！我第二名哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb6d80cfe4a7eecfc482859c5afd5a726e7465dc403ffe793d74f6c898fb41d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:743631e1adbccdbe7115d12a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我第三名！很厉害吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "76ef52981716a9a8161bcaa496a15e1b0e9eb8600f6c828e2838a7b0d231acbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ee9a442570c442ce73466f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有很努力跑了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ea3e7892e6e70251a88c703789b1df25ea2dda84866a863f525c4dfae17a49c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef726bdb7bf7743eb019608c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都很厉害呢──下次我一定不会输的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb4676c2d513b7ab8c501cfeaee969baf7c310b2a2de3a73d9ca69e7e9c24b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1895ced55196bf47a74c01d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊……！\r\n太棒了太棒了太棒了！第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "997fad9811fc1db621a560e4fa406a8f3dfdfe806a8f798c671fbb7311a41dcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:258996a91d2a0a49c93e6214",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哇哇哇，成功啦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec3ccf3287e4a0e6a2d4aa4cc177dea0540f4df2c711dc2aeab8f3aaa3f06aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebd5ab895b41d55b7e345f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了就要动用毛笔呢！\r\n画下胜利的……满分标志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6493cb0b3a2c338fd9a73317554eb6d157d5ad1107368f92eb531e992b06f2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d57f0c2ef344c5e61799261",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哇哇哇，成功啦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec3ccf3287e4a0e6a2d4aa4cc177dea0540f4df2c711dc2aeab8f3aaa3f06aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a884730318c3d10b60aedc44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参赛了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad0ab18de5c9e2fc6fc85073e7431714bcc7f8fcd2a0efe8b46c661c778f0e7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35fbdb150ea032dd8ef8bf9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让大家充满期待感的──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "855a8ec0642c3264c36ac3ebecb720c3ff38707924b02db2e038b1038b897007",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62fc6bdc5fd0a8250e030569",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说有赛马娘的歌牌喔！\r\n好──我要加油，\r\n好好练习了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68920e7e6bbd74232b0b1ad33efcfcff85529c353d2758e042e6774b38a2f0be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd93d62060d23387e39fc3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたし、ビューティードリーム\r\nカップで、ライスちゃんたち\r\nみんなと走りたいのっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e332b24d977f078e4f1641f51abe8b0c88c50b3628be6806b6904912b9ba8316",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b784a8c72a606c99bb69726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カワカミちゃんと握力修行～！\r\n硬い物を片っ端から握りつぶーす！\r\n今日は～ココナッツとかどうだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "980f7f7f668e8002f23aa8a26b6f582a7143ee1cd2091079746b112f22740140",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6fc8ac14e2e787ef1fe87c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ビューティーさんの勝負服と\r\n一緒に走って、ぜったい\r\n1着とっちゃうよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1356a29a808a49575a590def6c3ce40c21ce4c1b23954435ca4575d878aa1000",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7343a28b0f964c72dc212220",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶──拿到了！\r\n因为有春天和乌拉拉，\r\n所以我有记住这首和歌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "529ce46d2d3c9b1f1494ba0cbf090ad8eb227fb11bf29787c34100d09bfb1199",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b34590be5de92016684d4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让大家充满期待感的──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "855a8ec0642c3264c36ac3ebecb720c3ff38707924b02db2e038b1038b897007",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e890ec9ea65d55b7870f47e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像是活动任务喔！\r\n欸欸，要和我对决吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2fc748c86fd68b1e0dd970f207cf5479cad1522d456b8025fbf961774ce7a90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93488856cdab76f6707b0c0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动辛苦了──！\r\n有领取所有的报酬了吗？\r\n我也帮你一起搬喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92cfdebbd7c61289d2eef2b299af5c1f6c6892eaed97b2e8def24ec1391c38d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08f2fd56b8eb415941deaf59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乌拉拉Go！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb43bdc3a52495ab567400c3f37aec383614117eb23fc33b68a9c35a5d38778e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dce9003cf5a7dcd650195cc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌……是这个──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fcf6b903022b6e3d30b9dbe13eca0137d6d2619b33d16ba03a59138220317c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34471f897a09b724faa2b99e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧～！嗯～哇哇哇！嘿──！\r\n哎呀呀！……不过不要紧！\r\n我一直……都很兴奋的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04721af104749f89578a96616dfdde555d09aa9b74cd69dc709bb1fe3fe66547",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5be0fff3fbdac4fd442cd265",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お稽古合宿楽しいね！練習にごはん\r\nそれとババ抜き！でもなんでみんな\r\nわたしがババ持ってるのわかるの？",
